      },
      "Dialogue": {
        "Speaker": "Tywin",
        "Lines": [
          "Enough - you've made your point, my good sir.",
          "Good. Most don't last this long. Most aren't worth the road.",
          "You are. So I'll walk it with you a while - if only to see how it ends."
        ]
